# Build context exclusions for server/Dockerfile.
#
# This file is load-bearing: the Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so without it
# server/.env (real Supabase credentials) and node_modules are baked into
# the image. See SEC-4 in CODEBASE_REVIEW.md.
#
# Do not exclude index.js, config/, healthcheck.js, or package*.json —
# all four are required at build or run time.

# Secrets. The reason this file exists.
.env*

# Dependencies are reinstalled in-image by `npm ci`; copying the host's
# node_modules bloats the context and can smuggle in the wrong platform's
# native builds.
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# VCS and Docker metadata
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile

# Docs
*.md

# Test and coverage artifacts
coverage
.nyc_output

# Editor and OS cruft
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
